# Normally `stepout init` writes the key into Home's .env (Home: data/ in a checkout, else %LOCALAPPDATA%\Stepout). This file is for development and other providers: copy it to .env (gitignored). Never commit real values.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USER_ID=
STEPOUT_TASK_CAP_USD=1.00
# Optional: run the Roles on another provider. Each value is a Pydantic AI model string; leave both unset to use Claude through the Anthropic API.
# "strong" runs the Orchestrator and the Web Browsing agent; "cheap" runs Screening and the Web Research, Local File Finder and Local File Reader agents.
# STEPOUT_STRONG_MODEL=openrouter:anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6
# STEPOUT_CHEAP_MODEL=openrouter:google/gemini-3-flash-preview
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional: the app log (Home's logs/stepout.log). DEBUG, INFO (default), WARNING or ERROR.
# STEPOUT_LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# Optional: the most the app may spend in a calendar month, in dollars (default 10.00). At the limit a message is answered with a line and costs nothing.
# STEPOUT_MONTH_CAP_USD=10.00
# Optional: days to keep a Run's screenshots before they are removed at start (default 30).
# STEPOUT_RETENTION_DAYS=30
# Optional, for debugging: set to 1 to keep each Run's prompts and replies in Home's capture/ (never for a Run that read a file; secrets redacted; removed with the chat or after STEPOUT_RETENTION_DAYS).
# STEPOUT_CAPTURE=1
# Memory (ADR 0016). With OPENAI_API_KEY set, learned facts and earlier tasks are kept in Mem0 (embedded with OpenAI text-embedding-3-small: a text of yours goes to OpenAI to be turned into numbers).
# Without it, plain files are used. STEPOUT_MEMORY overrides: off | files | mem0.
# Mem0 is the optional extra: `stepout[mem0]` must be installed for it to be used (a source checkout's `pip install -e ".[dev]"` includes it).
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# STEPOUT_MEMORY=

# Optional: the web chat's port (default 8765; falls back to PORT). It may be set here. A second copy needs its own port and its own STEPOUT_HOME.
# STEPOUT_PORT=8765

# Set in the real environment, not in this file (it is read after Home is found): where Stepout keeps its data.
# STEPOUT_HOME=
# Written by `stepout remote` and removed by `stepout remote off`. Do not edit these by hand.
# STEPOUT_REMOTE_HOSTS=
# STEPOUT_REMOTE_LOGIN=
